# Font Directory

## Current Setup
The project uses **Space Grotesk** (Google Fonts) as the heading font, which provides a modern, geometric aesthetic similar to General Sans and Cabinet Grotesk.

## Optional: Upgrade to General Sans

For an even more premium look, you can replace Space Grotesk with General Sans:

### Steps:
1. Download General Sans from [Fontshare](https://www.fontshare.com/fonts/general-sans)
2. Place `GeneralSans-Variable.woff2` in this directory
3. Update `Frontend/src/app/layout.tsx`:

```typescript
import localFont from 'next/font/local';

const generalSans = localFont({
  src: './fonts/GeneralSans-Variable.woff2',
  variable: '--font-heading',
  display: 'swap',
  weight: '400 700',
});

// In the return statement:
<html lang="en" className={`${generalSans.variable} ${manrope.variable} ${plusJakarta.variable}`}>
```

### Alternative Premium Fonts:
- **Cabinet Grotesk** - [Download](https://www.fontshare.com/fonts/cabinet-grotesk)
- **Clash Display** - [Download](https://www.fontshare.com/fonts/clash-display)
- **Satoshi** - [Download](https://www.fontshare.com/fonts/satoshi)

All fonts from Fontshare are free for personal and commercial use.

